                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2839292,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Once this has been done, the syrup is ready to be packaged so that it can be used for a whole variety of products. It takes 40 liters of sap to produce one liter of maple syrup so you can get an idea of how much is needed. So that's the basic process. In places like Quebec",
            "children": [
